<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to appeal Telebras ruling - attorney.</title>
<headline>Brazil to appeal Telebras ruling - attorney.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian government will challenge in the Supreme Federal Tribunal (STF) a court ruling in favor of a 1990 subscription offer by state telecom holding Telebras, an official from the federal attorney's office said.</p>
<p>Once today's ruling by the Federal Regional Tribunal is published next week, the federal attorney's office will have 15 days to lodge an appeal with the STF, the official said.</p>
<p>-- William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358</p>
</text>
